WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.229 --> 00:00:08.230
In this class, you have taken your first steps into Twinmotion, a real-time visualization tool based on Unreal Engine.

2
00:00:08.949 --> 00:00:13.050
You've experimented with a typical workflow, first by ingesting data.

3
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:18.850
You then learned to add context on how to embellish the scene with the help of an extensive assets library.

4
00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:27.410
You added materials, characters and vehicles among other things, and learned how to create and store your own user library.

5
00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:32.340
You also learned how to create and scatter vegetation for a more natural environment.

6
00:00:33.039 --> 00:00:39.539
The next class will teach you other tools in Twinmotion, which will include creating and adjusting man-made lights for night scenes,

7
00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:45.240
as well as outputting media to disk in the form of images, panoramas and videos.

8
00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:46.740
See you then!
